# GET /drain — step 3: answer with the accumulated page and the loop's
# bookkeeping. `_page` and `_txc` are `_`-prefixed and never reach the
# body on their own, so copy what the reader should see onto plain keys;
# the web inlet renders the envelope minus `_`-keys as JSON.
WHEN ._page.count != null
  EMIT .keys = ._page.keys,
       .loop = @runtime.repeat.drain,
       @web.res.status = 200,
       @halt = true
